- Okei. Jah.
- Kas keegi on siin?

469
00:37:44.020 --> 00:37:45.020
Keegi on siin.

470
00:37:46.816 --> 00:37:48.335
See kena naine. Ta tuleb varsti.

471
00:37:48.473 --> 00:37:50.406
Ta aitab meid. Jah? Ta teab, mida teha.

472
00:37:50.544 --> 00:37:51.890
Okei. Jah.

473
00:38:45.978 --> 00:38:47.117
Hinga, hinga, hinga.

474
00:38:48.912 --> 00:38:49.912
See on okei.

475
00:38:59.337 --> 00:39:00.338
See ei tule lahti.

476
00:39:01.304 --> 00:39:02.478
Sa kaotad palju verd.

477
00:39:05.998 --> 00:39:07.358
Kutt, me peame kiiresti tegutsema.

478
00:39:08.242 --> 00:39:09.242
Ta on lõksus.

479
00:39:14.075 --> 00:39:15.111
Muud võimalust pole.

480
00:39:16.146 --> 00:39:17.355
Ta verest tühjaks.

481
00:39:17.493 --> 00:39:19.667
Ben, sellest pole kasu.

482
00:39:19.805 --> 00:39:20.979
Ära ole loll.

483
00:39:21.117 --> 00:39:22.808
Niikuinii on minu aeg läbi

484
00:39:24.016 --> 00:39:25.811
