535
00:44:37.640 --> 00:44:39.884
See, keda ma aitama hakkan, on see väike sell siin.

536
00:44:41.057 --> 00:44:42.852
- Lähme.
- Ma oskan ronida.

537
00:44:42.990 --> 00:44:45.510
Ma olen hea ronija. Näita, mida sa suudad, äss.

538
00:44:46.373 --> 00:44:48.202
Okei. Jah.

539
00:44:50.791 --> 00:44:52.671
Kui kaua läheb aega, enne kui nad meid leiavad?

540
00:44:54.864 --> 00:44:57.315
See võib võtta tunni või mitu tundi.

541
00:45:00.767 --> 00:45:01.847
See on juhul, kui nad signaali kätte said.

542
00:45:01.871 --> 00:45:02.976
"Juhul"?

543
00:45:04.460 --> 00:45:06.500
Kui avariisaatja aktiveerus, kui me alla kukkusime.

544
00:45:07.981 --> 00:45:09.016
Ja kui ei aktiveerunud?

545
00:45:12.813 --> 00:45:14.746
Jah.

546
00:45:14.884 --> 00:45:16.679
Seepärast ma lähengi natukeseks ujuma.

547
00:45:18.163 --> 00:45:19.751
See on keskosast.

548
00:45:19.889 --> 00:45:22.650
Ma võtaksin parve, aga sina võid seda vajada.

549
00:45:24.031 --> 00:45:25.031
Lase mul minna.

550
00:45:26.068 --> 00:45:27.759
Waikiki Roughwater. Kolm korda.

551
00:45:29.865 --> 00:45:32.143
Ma saan sellega hakkama, eks? Usalda mind.

552
00:45:33.523 --> 00:45:35.594
Jah. Kuhu sa lähed?

553
00:45:35.733 --> 00:45:37.665
Um... Lennuki keskosasse.

554
00:45:38.943 --> 00:45:40.151
Kas mu ema ja isa on seal?

555
00:45:44.155 --> 00:45:45.225
Ma tahan kaasa tulla.

556
00:45:45.363 --> 00:45:47.227
Noh, ma pean ujuma, kullake.

557
00:45:47.365 --> 00:45:49.781
Ma oskan ujuda. See on liiga kaugel.

558
00:45:49.919 --> 00:45:52.335
Eks? Aga ma otsin su vanemad üles, ma luban.

559
00:45:52.473 --> 00:45:54.234
Ja mu väikevend Finn.

560
00:45:54.372 --> 00:45:55.753
Tema nimi on Finn.

561
00:45:56.408 --> 00:45:57.408
Penny.

562
00:45:58.445 --> 00:46:00.136
Kui sa sinna välja jõuad,

563
00:46:00.274 --> 00:46:01.793
signaali kinnitamiseks... Olgu.

564
00:46:01.931 --> 00:46:03.451
...et ELT töötab, eks?

565
00:46:03.553 --> 00:46:06.177
See läheb logiraamatusse, eks?

566
00:46:06.315 --> 00:46:08.213
Kõlbab küll komissarile. Peakomissarile.

567
00:46:09.836 --> 00:46:12.562
Siin, võta see. Ei, see teeb mind vaid aeglasemaks.

568
00:46:14.254 --> 00:46:17.705
Kuule. Kas saaksid neid minu eest hoida, kuni ma tagasi tulen?

569
00:46:19.397 --> 00:46:20.743
Aitäh.

570
00:46:20.881 --> 00:46:22.652
See on laes, tüürpoordis, 20. reas.

571
00:46:22.676 --> 00:46:24.091
Olgu.

572
00:46:24.229 --> 00:46:26.629
Vajuta lihtsalt lülitit ja veendu, et tuli jääb põlema, eks?

573
00:46:27.439 --> 00:46:28.958
Kuule, edu.

574
00:46:38.554 --> 00:46:39.954
Me leiame su pere üles, Cora.

575
00:46:40.694 --> 00:46:41.694
Eks?

576
00:46:52.671 --> 00:46:53.741
Sa saad hakkama, Becky.

577
00:46:53.880 --> 00:46:55.778
Olen su kannul, äss.

578
00:46:55.916 --> 00:46:57.607
Selle suure kolaka pärast ma muretsengi.

579
00:46:57.745 --> 00:46:59.782
Selge. Tore.

580
00:46:59.920 --> 00:47:02.267
Nüüd siis Shelley Winters ajab paska, jah?

581
00:47:03.959 --> 00:47:05.443
Näita seda. Seisa paigal.

582
00:47:06.306 --> 00:47:07.825
Pane käsi siia, eks?

583
00:47:19.215 --> 00:47:20.423
Härra.

584
00:47:32.642 --> 00:47:33.643
Hai.

585
00:47:33.781 --> 00:47:35.783
Hai! Hai!

586
00:47:39.477 --> 00:47:41.272
Hai! Penny!

587
00:47:42.963 --> 00:47:45.069
Penny, hai!

588
00:47:46.691 --> 00:47:47.968
Penny!

589
00:47:51.075 --> 00:47:52.075
Ei!

590
00:47:52.973 --> 00:47:54.250
Hai! Penny!

591
00:47:55.424 --> 00:47:57.667
Penny! Hai!

592
00:47:57.805 --> 00:47:59.083
Hai! Pane see selga.

593
00:47:59.877 --> 00:48:00.878
Hai!

594
00:48:05.848 --> 00:48:06.953
Oota, kingad. Kingad.

595
00:48:09.300 --> 00:48:10.300
Tule nüüd.

596
00:48:11.992 --> 00:48:13.442
Hoia käed veest eemal.

597
00:48:14.719 --> 00:48:16.203
Ei! Peata!

598
00:48:16.341 --> 00:48:18.757
Mis? Kas me ei pääse nii välja?

599
00:48:18.896 --> 00:48:20.690
Päästeparve avamine? Me oleme õhumullis.

600
00:48:22.037 --> 00:48:23.152
Kui me tihendi lõhume, siis me upume.

601
00:48:23.176 --> 00:48:24.211
Aga...

602
00:48:28.802 --> 00:48:30.424
Jah, okei, okei. Jah.

603
00:48:31.805 --> 00:48:33.117
Viis.

604
00:48:33.945 --> 00:48:35.809
Vabandust. Olgu.

605
00:49:06.460 --> 00:49:07.461
Penny!

606
00:49:07.599 --> 00:49:09.705
Penny! Hai!

607
00:49:10.775 --> 00:49:12.225
Penny!

608
00:49:12.363 --> 00:49:13.536
Hai vees!

609
00:49:14.917 --> 00:49:15.953
Me tuleme!

610
00:49:17.989 --> 00:49:18.989
Penny!

611
00:49:20.888 --> 00:49:22.235
Penny! Hai!

612
00:49:27.654 --> 00:49:28.931
Aita mind!

613
00:49:31.796 --> 00:49:32.970
Penny!

614
00:49:35.800 --> 00:49:39.631
Penny! Penny, me tuleme! Me tuleme!

615
00:49:43.808 --> 00:49:45.465
Tule! Anna mulle oma käsi!

616
00:49:49.434 --> 00:49:50.884
Penny.

617
00:49:51.022 --> 00:49:52.022
Penny.

618
00:50:29.233 --> 00:50:31.166
- Me vajume.
- Kus kurat me oleme?

619
00:50:31.304 --> 00:50:32.305
Me vajume.

620
00:50:33.616 --> 00:50:34.755
Mis kurat...

621
00:50:34.893 --> 00:50:36.412
Sul on suur haav.

622
00:50:36.550 --> 00:50:38.311
Lase ma aitan sind. See pole midagi.

623
00:50:57.537 --> 00:50:59.470
Uju minu juurde! Uju minu juurde!

624
00:51:03.819 --> 00:51:05.234
Siin. Ma sain sust kinni!

625
00:51:11.309 --> 00:51:12.690
Tule siia.

626
00:51:16.142 --> 00:51:17.142
Kas sa oled korras?

627
00:51:43.514 --> 00:51:44.894
Kuidas see tundub?

628
00:51:45.032 --> 00:51:46.032
Vähem kohutavalt.

629
00:51:47.207 --> 00:51:48.657
Tänan, et sa mu korda tegid.

630
00:51:48.795 --> 00:51:50.195
Ja vabanda selle ukse asja pärast.

631
00:51:51.487 --> 00:51:52.971
Jah.

632
00:51:53.110 --> 00:51:54.663
Meil saab kõik korda.

633
00:51:55.698 --> 00:51:57.459
Me peame ta maha rahustama.

634
00:51:57.597 --> 00:52:00.876
Muidu saab meil õhk otsa, ja väga varsti.

635
00:52:01.670 --> 00:52:02.670
Väike mees.

636
00:52:04.328 --> 00:52:05.448
Kas sa lendad oma perega?

637
00:52:06.640 --> 00:52:09.229
Minu emme ja minu uus issi

638
00:52:10.023 --> 00:52:11.714
